Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 11:10:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Add One UI Quick Settings as an experiment

Wi-Fi and Bluetooth pills, a paged card of round toggles, lying brightness and volume rows, the player and large tiles as pills. It overrides the chosen style and holds the split shade without changing either, so switching it off restores both.
